	loading=&#34;lazy&#34;
	
		alt=&#34;运行docker&#34;
	
	
		class=&#34;gallery-image&#34; 
		data-flex-grow=&#34;158&#34;
		data-flex-basis=&#34;380px&#34;
	
&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;52-容器运行状态&#34;&gt;5.2 容器运行状态
